abstract: >-
  A mechanism-grounded, variant-aware drug-repurposing hypothesis portfolio
  for one reported BUB1B-associated MVA genotype (MVA Hackathon 2026, Track 2).
  No approved medicine completes a demonstrated exact-genotype causal chain;
  Tier 1 is empty.
keywords:
  - mosaic variegated aneuploidy
  - BUB1B
  - BubR1
  - drug repurposing
  - spindle-assembly checkpoint
